            <title>[LU-21018] sanity-lnet test_150: unexpected peer from a foreign node in the export compared after import</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21018</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;sanity-lnet test_150 (and the other import tests that compare "lnetctl export --backup" with the export after "lnetctl import") fails when an unrelated node talks to the test node while the test runs.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Failed test set: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/e8847e09-1bb6-4fdf-acf5-63a62d52a203" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/e8847e09-1bb6-4fdf-acf5-63a62d52a203&lt;/a&gt; (session 0f99ad1c-e041-4bb0-99aa-f2d364661605, lustre-reviews 134096, el8.10 review-ldiskfs, 2026-10-21)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The test configures eth0 (10.240.46.152@tcp), runs "lnetctl export --backup" as the expected output, unconfigures, and imports the ip2nets yaml. The expected output carries a peer section the import cannot reproduce:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;peer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class="alternate" type="square"&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;primary nid: 10.240.46.149@tcp&lt;br/&gt;
      Multi-Rail: true&lt;br/&gt;
      peer ni:&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;nid: 10.240.46.149@tcp&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;10.240.46.149 is not one of the four test nodes of the session. The node console shows it connecting to this node earlier in the suite: "LNetError: Refusing connection from 10.240.46.149 for 10.240.46.152@tcp: No matching NI". So inbound traffic from a foreign node created a peer entry between "net add" and "export", and the actual output after import (a fresh lnet configure) has no such peer. Nothing in the test fails to import.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The test should compare only the net and global sections, or export only those (lnetctl export --backup with peers filtered out), rather than requiring an empty peer table on a shared subnet.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Seen once in about 13900 sanity-lnet suite runs over 30 days.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Raised by Patch Watcher run pw-engineer-69735-ps3-b2ff6565fcd6 on &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/69735" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/69735&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
